  "body": "Auction: 34 Shortland Street, City on Wednesday 11 November 2026 at 10:00AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nIf you’re ready to stop paying rent and step onto the property ladder, and you’re not afraid to roll up your sleeves, this one-bedroom unit offers a genuine opportunity to create a first home with real potential.\r\n\r\nPositioned at the end of the block and elevated above its neighbours, it enjoys arguably the best position in the building, capturing exceptional views towards the city and across the pony club. Set in a quiet no-exit street with the convenience of a carport, the fundamentals are all here.\r\n\r\nThe interior is ready for a full refresh, giving you a blank canvas to update to your own taste and add value along the way. With a little vision and effort, this could become a really special first home or quiet place to retire.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n• Elevated end unit in the best position in the block\r\n\r\n• Exceptional views towards the city and the pony club\r\n\r\n• Quiet no-exit street\r\n\r\n• Carport parking\r\n\r\nRenovation opportunity to add value and personalise",
